      "cooked": "<p>Spoilers Abound! (Obviously)</p><p>On Tuesday's Livestream, Christopher and Maggie showed us their Production Copy of OblivAeon. However, I didn't see a discussion thread for it, so I am making it!<br><br>If you haven't watched it, go watch it :) <a href=\"http://www.twitch.tv/videos/261703913\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">www.twitch.tv/videos/261703913</a><br><br>And now I can talk about the Hairdryer without spoiling people! I've been holding on to that one since GenCon last year :D<br><br>~Komori</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p>",
